WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.969
Proxima Centauri.

00:02.669 --> 00:07.480
The nearest star to the Sun, a dim red one an eighth of the Sun's mass.

00:07.930 --> 00:10.060
It has at least one planet.

00:10.510 --> 00:15.396
Every star you can see with your eyes at night is farther away than this one.
